sequenceDiagram
    participant Buyer
    participant Seller as Seller (x402 resource server)
    participant Facilitator as Facilitator (exact scheme)
    participant Service as Payment service

    Note over Buyer,Service: AWS Marketplace Agentic Commerce payment on x402 (exact scheme)

    Buyer->>Seller: 1. GET /resource
    Seller->>Seller: 2. Sign a quote token with the seller key
    Seller-->>Buyer: 3. 402 Payment Required<br/>accepts[0].extra.quoteToken, payTo = sentinel

    Buyer->>Service: 4. Obtain a payment token for the quote
    Service->>Service: 5. Authorize and capture the payment
    Service-->>Buyer: 6. Payment token (signed)<br/>quote_token, payment_id, cnf.jkt if DPoP-bound

    Buyer->>Seller: 7. GET /resource<br/>PAYMENT-SIGNATURE { paymentToken, paymentId }, DPoP proof
    Seller->>Seller: 8. onBeforeVerify: check the DPoP proof of a bound token
    Seller->>Facilitator: 9. verify(payload, requirements)
    Facilitator->>Service: 10. Fetch the payment service JWKS
    Facilitator->>Facilitator: 11. Payment token signature, issuer, expiry<br/>Same quote the buyer accepted<br/>Quote signature with the configured seller key<br/>Audience, quote expiry, price, currency, product

    alt Payment valid
        Facilitator-->>Seller: 12. isValid: true
        Seller->>Facilitator: 13. settle: no-op, returns payment_id
        Seller-->>Buyer: 14. 200 OK + resource, PAYMENT-RESPONSE
    else Payment invalid
        Facilitator-->>Seller: 12. isValid: false, invalidReason
        Seller-->>Buyer: 13. 402 Payment Required
    end
